seg-4156a7515574 = ── THE CORRECTION LINK ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── The identity above assumes a PERFECT correction: computed by a station that knows exactly where it stands, delivered instantly, at infinite resolution. None of the three holds, and the three inputs below model what each costs. They feed the <c1/> block of the result document ONLY -- with all three at the values written h (scenario file comment, lines { "57" } to { "62" })

